      "adaptation": "Selected status/inventory, stop/start, capture and load responsibilities become six closed protocol method names, one canonical effective target and exact raw load snapshot bytes. Pinned official DTOs derive Candid arguments. Management receiver and update-ingress mode are fixed; capture retains code and never replaces a snapshot; host sender-canister version stays absent. Request digest binds exact routing/mode/method/bytes. No raw command/program/config/preflight flag, backend token converter, download/upload runner or target-version CAS is copied."
    }
