      "description": "Fresh strict v1 admission, exact payload-binding, raw-byte bounds and pinned DTO decoding tests. Six registered golden argument/digest vectors are independently constructed using principal CRC/base32 decoding, Candid label hashes, signed/unsigned LEB128, parent-first type tables and value encoding, plus the documented binary wire-digest framing. No production Rust/Candid encoder is used to generate the golden bytes. The persisted model reconstructs private argument caches and rejects cache/authority/unsafe-option injection."
    },
    {
