      ],
      "description": "Public native recovery retains exact typed payload through existing bounded JSON ops, binds its digest into the original plan/attempt authority and reopens already-consumed mutation/independent observation allowances. Qualified local Uncertain receipt fixtures preserve the unresolved mutation and prevent blind retry. No management backend is modeled or called."
    }
